            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.20</h2>
<ul>
<li>ShawNotch uses far less memory: about 20 MB when it starts, and about 50 MB while Music Mode shows an album, down from 150 MB.</li>
<li>Music Mode's poster lets go of its memory when the music stops, and so does the Mirror's light when you switch it off.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
